The MIT license above covers the CODE in this repository and the two background
images owned by the project owner (`bg.jpg` / `bg2.jpg`) only.

Song data (`songs.json`) and cover artwork (`covers/`) are NOT included and are
NOT licensed here. The original site icon is third-party artwork and is likewise
